    --name=<n>            proposers over the site repo's captured state/**, emitting
    [--match=<regex>]     grammar-shaped CANDIDATES a human ratifies by hand. Facts
    [--evidence=<file>]   land in real classification sections; proposals and
    [--seed=<file>]       unsupported surfaces nest INERT under a `_draft` sidecar
    [--out=<path>]        (trigger keys renamed so no validator mis-collects them),
    [--force]             each carrying status/confidence/evidence/questions. Every
    [--format=json]
    [--check-proposals]
